  "about": "Link vectors for private.is_valid_link (spine AD-24), read by supabase/tests/tasks/reference_links.test.sql and Story 8.15's Vitest. `valid` is what is_valid_link returns for `url` right-padded with 'a' to `pad_to` characters when given; `url` may be null. U+0000 is left out: Postgres text cannot hold it.",
